      "last": {
        "speaker": 0,
        "line": 672,
        "text": "One month ago, I had a nice apartment in Chicago. I had a good job. I had a son. When something happened to the Negroes in the South, I said ‘That’s their business, not mine.’ Now I know how wrong I was."
      }
